WEBVTT

00:05:27.079 --> 00:05:30.621
the people that work in Hollywood are
wildly imaginative and wildly talented.

00:05:30.621 --> 00:05:32.329
And it is a joy to be able
to work with them.

00:05:32.746 --> 00:05:36.871
I think that the the difficulty and the
frustration is that the industry,

00:05:36.871 --> 00:05:39.746
you know, people are running
scared at all times.

00:05:40.038 --> 00:05:42.538
And the decisions that are made
about the economics of

00:05:42.538 --> 00:05:45.663
the business are made based on
a set of conventional wisdom.

00:05:45.663 --> 00:05:49.996
That is all conventional wisdom that has
been passed down through generations.

00:05:50.454 --> 00:05:54.121
And implicit in that sort of passed down,
conventional wisdom is a ton of bias,

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:57.329
some of which is, you know,
sort of innocuous.

00:05:57.329 --> 00:05:59.954
And a lot of it is is terribly dangerous.
Right.